# Documentation and non-AWS deploy config. Excluded because this directory is
# now a CDK DockerImageAsset build context, and CDK hashes that context to tag
# the image: anything included here means a docs-only edit produces a new image
# tag and a real production redeploy of the Lambda.
#
# That already happened once. Editing render.yaml on 11 Aug 2026 to mark it
# historical changed the asset hash, and the next CI run rebuilt and shipped a
# new converter image for a comment change. Harmless, but it makes deploys look
# meaningful when they are not.
